# P115 on WSL GTK: Toggle(isOn:label:) in the switch / checkbox / button styles and Link(destination:label:) with two-view labels. Steps wait 3 s: under WSLg the push took about 3 s to land (2026-10-29).
# Each control is pressed by the text inside its label (taplabel) -- a click on the label itself.
# Pass: the log has switch -> true / checkbox -> true / button -> true / string -> true / link opened p115://link-label in that order; the final capture shows all four toggles on (the view-label and string-label button toggles drawn alike) and link presses: 1.
